# Astro's sitemap integration names the index `sitemap-index.xml`, and
# robots.txt points at that. Crawlers and audit tools still probe the
# conventional `/sitemap.xml` by habit and got a 404. Forward it rather than
# duplicating the file, so there is one sitemap and one place it is generated.
